{"id":"wb-2-10","name":"宋庆龄墓","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"宋庆龄墓","text":"宋庆龄墓，是中华民国国父孙中山的最后一位夫人、中华人民共和国名誉主席宋庆龄的陵墓，位于上海市长宁区虹桥街道中华人民共和国名誉主席宋庆龄陵园（原万国公墓）宋庆龄父母之墓的旁边。宋庆龄墓于1981年落成，于1982年2月23日被国务院公布为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%AE%8B%E5%BA%86%E9%BE%84%E5%A2%93","revisionId":95276512,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95276512","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/90be7fd90522c55891cadee3.jpg","title":"Soong's_Tomb_in_Shanghai.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Soong%27s_Tomb_in_Shanghai.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/74/Soong%27s_Tomb_in_Shanghai.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Chintunglee","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​宋庆龄陵园内宋庆龄的陵墓。","width":320,"height":180}}